<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">KEEP THE CONVERSATION GOING</text><text class="title">相聚之前，先聊聊</text><text class="block muted section">集合地点、出发时间，还有一句“周末见”。</text><view class="notice">演示消息仅保存在本机，不会发给其他用户。</view>
<view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-icon">☏</view><text class="subtitle">和新朋友打个招呼</text><text class="block muted section">使用演示身份后，查看你加入的拼团。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="login">使用演示身份</button></view>
<block wx:elif="{{conversations.length}}"><button wx:for="{{conversations}}" wx:key="groupId" class="conversation card" data-id="{{item.groupId}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><view class="avatar">{{item.symbol}}</view><view class="grow"><text class="block conversation-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="block muted small preview">{{item.preview}}</text></view><text class="muted">›</text></view><view class="small muted section">{{item.dateLabel}} · 我方 {{item.joinedSeats}} 人</view></button></block>
<view wx:else class="empty"><view class="empty-icon">⋯</view><text class="subtitle">你的下一场相聚，还在路上</text><text class="block muted section">加入一个拼团后，会话就会出现在这里。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="home">去发现一个拼团</button></view></view>
